    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Since the petitioner herein seeks for bail for offences under Section 376(DA) of IPC and Section 6 of POCSO Act, the informant and victim are required to be noticed and informed before taking up the hearing in the matter, in view of the provision under Section 439(1A) of CrPC and Sub-rule 13 and 15 (viii) of Rule-4 of the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Rules, 2020 (in short, \"the Rules\").\n3. For the purpose of notice to the informant and information of victim-child in terms of the above Act and Rules, let the copy of the bail application received by the learned counsel for the State be sent to the informant and victim by Mr. K.K. Gaya, learned ASC through concerned Police Station indicating therein the probable date of hearing.\nDigitally Signed 4.",
